@startuml session-status-state
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
[*] --> IDLE : no STATUS event yet
IDLE --> RUNNING : start(runId, timeout)\nappends STATUS(RUNNING, runId, expiresAt)
RUNNING --> RUNNING : start(runId) after the lease ran out\nappends STATUS(IDLE, oldRunId, EXPIRED) + STATUS(RUNNING, runId)
RUNNING --> IDLE : end(runId, END_TURN | ERROR | CANCELLED)\nappends STATUS(IDLE, runId, stopReason)
RUNNING --> IDLE : interrupt(reason)\nappends INTERRUPT + STATUS(IDLE, runId, INTERRUPTED)
IDLE --> IDLE : interrupt(reason)\nappends INTERRUPT only
IDLE : the newest STATUS event, or none
RUNNING : the run id owns the turn
RUNNING : start by anyone throws TurnInProgressException\nuntil the lease, if any, ran out
RUNNING : end by another run id is a no-op
@enduml
